<p>Dino Esposito</p>
<p><a href="https://technet.microsoft.com/en-us/AssetId:e11d2af9-d5a3-4c64-9fa8-942d6e9c8af0" title="Bugslayer" data-linktype="external">Bugslayer:</a>&nbsp;<a href="https://technet.microsoft.com/en-us/AssetId:e11d2af9-d5a3-4c64-9fa8-942d6e9c8af0" title="Assertions and Tracing in .NET" data-linktype="external">Assertions and Tracing in .NET</a></p>
<p>John Robbins</p>
<p><a href="https://technet.microsoft.com/en-us/AssetId:80bfaec6-5237-47e3-be27-c6b2ac15315e" title=".NET Column" data-linktype="external">.NET Column:</a>&nbsp;<a href="https://technet.microsoft.com/en-us/AssetId:80bfaec6-5237-47e3-be27-c6b2ac15315e" title="Special .NET Type Members" data-linktype="external">Special .NET Type Members</a></p>
